graph TD
    A[Termination Signal] --> B{Termination Type?}
    B -->|PolyA Signal| C[PolyA Signal Recognition]
    B -->|Terminator Sequence| D[Terminator Recognition]
    B -->|Rho-Dependent| E[Rho Factor Binding]
    
    C --> F[CPSF Binding]
    F --> G[PolyA Site Cleavage]
    G --> H[PolyA Tail Addition]
    H --> I[Transcription Termination]
    
    D --> J[Terminator Sequence]
    J --> K[RNA Hairpin Formation]
    K --> L[Transcription Termination]
    
    E --> M[Rho Helicase Activity]
    M --> N[RNA Release]
    N --> L
    
    I --> O[Transcription Termination Complete]
    L --> O
    
    %% Alternative pathway
    A --> P[Antitermination Factor]
    P --> Q[Transcription Continuation]
    Q --> R[Readthrough Transcription]
    
    %% Regulation
    O --> S[Termination Status]
    S --> T{Termination Required?}
    T -->|Yes| U[Termination Activation]
    T -->|No| V[Termination Inhibition]
    
    %% Key proteins
    W[CPSF] --> F
    X[PolyA Polymerase] --> H
    Y[Rho Factor] --> E
    Z[Antitermination Factors] --> P
    AA[Termination Factors] --> I
    BB[Cleavage Factors] --> G
    
    %% Styling
    style A fill:#ff6b6b
    style B fill:#45b7d1
    style C fill:#feca57
    style D fill:#4ecdc4
    style E fill:#feca57
    style F fill:#feca57
    style G fill:#4ecdc4
    style H fill:#4ecdc4
    style I fill:#96ceb4
    style J fill:#45b7d1
